Gravitino Enterprise is a mixed distribution.

This binary package contains three categories of material:

  1. Apache Gravitino-derived code, licensed under the Apache License,
     Version 2.0. The full Apache License 2.0 text is in LICENSE-APACHE,
     which is shipped next to this file.

  2. Bundled third-party open source software. License texts are in the
     licenses/ directory. A catalog of those components follows below.

  3. Proprietary Datastrato code, which is not licensed under the Apache
     License, Version 2.0. See LICENSE-ENTERPRISE, which is shipped next
     to this file.

Do not treat this binary package as Apache-licensed as a whole.

   The Web UI also bundles various third-party components also under
   different licenses, please see web/LICENSE.bin for these.

